  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>With the ZOLLER »conDress 200« dressing machine, you can reliably remove deposits from diamond-coated grinding surfaces and from the gaps in the diamond coating. </p> <p>This restores the cutting performance of your stone-processing tools—ensuring consistently efficient grinding processes and precise machining results. Thanks to the machine’s robust design and simple operation, cleaning your tools remains safe and efficient. At the same time, you extend the lifetime of your diamond tools and measurably reduce your tooling costs.</p>",
